{"id":"a35d7c83-3204-41a0-ac8d-f81b3d5865d1","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:58:52.222Z","batchId":"onboarding_gpt-6-luna_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .wizard-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:8px 0 24px}\n  .wizard-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);color:inherit;opacity:.65}\n  .wizard-step[aria-current=\"step\"]{border-color:var(--primary,#2563eb);opacity:1;font-weight:600}\n  .step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:50%;font-size:.875rem;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .wizard-panel[hidden]{display:none}\n  @media(max-width:520px){.wizard-step{justify-content:center;padding:10px 4px}.wizard-step span:last-child{display:none}}\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <p class=\"small muted\">ACCOUNT SETUP</p>\n    <h1>Welcome — let’s get you set up</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">A few quick details will personalize your experience. You can change your preferences at any time.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\">\n    <nav class=\"wizard-steps\" aria-label=\"Setup progress\">\n      <div class=\"wizard-step\" data-step-indicator=\"1\" aria-current=\"step\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">1</span><span>Account</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wizard-step\" data-step-indicator=\"2\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">2</span><span>Preferences</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wizard-step\" data-step-indicator=\"3\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">3</span><span>Done</span>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"step-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">Step 1 of 3</p>\n\n    <form id=\"onboarding-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" novalidate>\n      <section class=\"wizard-panel stack gap-lg\" data-panel=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"account-title\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"account-title\">Create your account</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Enter your details to get started.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"label\">First name</span>\n            <input name=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"label\">Last name</span>\n            <input name=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" required>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Email address</span>\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Password</span>\n          <input name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"8\" required>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Use at least 8 characters.</span>\n        </label>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wizard-panel stack gap-lg\" data-panel=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"preferences-title\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"preferences-title\">Set your preferences</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what you’d like to hear about. These settings are easy to update later.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <fieldset class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <legend class=\"label\">What are you interested in?</legend>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"interests\" value=\"Product updates\"> Product updates</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"interests\" value=\"Tips and guides\"> Tips and guides</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"interests\" value=\"Community news\"> Community news</label>\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <fieldset class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <legend class=\"label\">Email frequency</legend>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"Weekly\" checked> Weekly</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"Monthly\"> Monthly</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"frequency\" value=\"Only important updates\"> Only important updates</label>\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"terms\" required>\n          I agree to the terms of service and privacy policy.\n        </label>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wizard-panel stack gap-lg\" data-panel=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"done-title\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"center stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Setup complete</span>\n          <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"done-title\">You’re all set, <span id=\"summary-name\">there</span>.</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Your account is ready. Here’s a summary of your setup.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3 class=\"h4\">Account</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\" id=\"summary-email\"></p>\n          <hr class=\"hr\">\n          <h3 class=\"h4\">Preferences</h3>\n          <p><strong>Topics:</strong> <span id=\"summary-interests\"></span></p>\n          <p><strong>Email frequency:</strong> <span id=\"summary-frequency\"></span></p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"between gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" id=\"back-button\" hidden>Back</button>\n        <span class=\"muted small\" id=\"validation-message\" role=\"alert\"></span>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"next-button\">Next</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    const form = document.getElementById(\"onboarding-form\");\n    const panels = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-panel]\"));\n    const indicators = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-step-indicator]\"));\n    const backButton = document.getElementById(\"back-button\");\n    const nextButton = document.getElementById(\"next-button\");\n    const stepCount = document.getElementById(\"step-count\");\n    const message = document.getElementById(\"validation-message\");\n    let currentStep = 1;\n\n    function showStep(step) {\n      currentStep = step;\n      panels.forEach(panel => {\n        panel.hidden = Number(panel.dataset.panel) !== step;\n      });\n      indicators.forEach(indicator => {\n        if (Number(indicator.dataset.stepIndicator) === step) {\n          indicator.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"step\");\n        } else {\n          indicator.removeAttribute(\"aria-current\");\n        }\n      });\n      stepCount.textContent = \"Step \" + step + \" of 3\";\n      backButton.hidden = step === 1;\n      nextButton.hidden = step === 3;\n      nextButton.textContent = step === 2 ? \"Complete setup\" : \"Next\";\n      message.textContent = \"\";\n      const heading = document.querySelector('[data-panel=\"' + step + '\"] h2');\n      if (heading) heading.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", \"-1\"), heading.focus();\n    }\n\n    function validateCurrentPanel() {\n      const panel = document.querySelector('[data-panel=\"' + currentStep + '\"]');\n      const fields = Array.from(panel.querySelectorAll(\"input\"));\n      for (const field of fields) {\n        if (!field.checkValidity()) {\n          field.reportValidity();\n          return false;\n        }\n      }\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    nextButton.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      if (!validateCurrentPanel()) {\n        message.textContent = \"Please complete the required fields to continue.\";\n        return;\n      }\n      if (currentStep === 2) {\n        const data = new FormData(form);\n        const firstName = (data.get(\"firstName\") || \"\").trim();\n        const interests = data.getAll(\"interests\");\n        document.getElementById(\"summary-name\").textContent = firstName || \"there\";\n        document.getElementById(\"summary-email\").textContent = data.get(\"email\") || \"\";\n        document.getElementById(\"summary-interests\").textContent = interests.length ? interests.join(\", \") : \"No topics selected\";\n        document.getElementById(\"summary-frequency\").textContent = data.get(\"frequency\") || \"Weekly\";\n      }\n      showStep(currentStep + 1);\n    });\n\n    backButton.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      if (currentStep > 1) showStep(currentStep - 1);\n    });\n\n    showStep(1);\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[8369,"<style"],[8376,">\n"],[8378," "],[8382," ."],[8385,"wizard"],[8389,"-"],[8392,"steps"],[8395,"{"],[8401,"display"],[8404,":grid"],[8407,";"],[8409,"grid"],[8412,"-template"],[8416,"-columns"],[8421,":"],[8422,"repeat"],[8425,"("],[8430,"3"],[8433,","],[8439,"1"],[8442,"fr"],[8444,");"],[8447,"gap"],[8451,":"],[8455,"12"],[8458,"px"],[8461,";margin"],[8466,":"],[8469,"8"],[8472,"px"],[8474," "],[8476,"0"],[8484," "],[8487,"24"],[8494,"px"],[8500,"}\n"],[8504," "],[8508," ."],[8513,"wizard"],[8516,"-step"],[8524,"{"],[8526,"display"],[8533,":flex"],[8539,";"],[8546,"align"],[8547,"-items"],[8549,":center"],[8553,";"],[8557,"